It carries code and assets from ryOS (https://github.com/ryokun6/ryos),
copyright its authors, under that same licence:

- apps/web/app/desktop/dock.tsx: the dock, its magnification, its labels, its
  dividers and its hiding.
- apps/web/app/desktop/window.tsx: the three lights on a window, the way a
  window leaves for the dock, and the glow where a carried window lands.
The dock's icons in apps/web/public/dock/ are Maslow's own, made for it as
one family of clear glass objects.

It carries the BoardUI design system (https://www.boardui.com), under
`apps/web/components/base`, `apps/web/components/application`,
`apps/web/components/foundations`, `apps/web/styles`, `apps/web/utils`
and `apps/web/hooks/use-count-up.ts`. The free components are MIT. The
Pro components and chart cards are under BoardUI's Pro licence, bought
by Maslow Industries: they may be shipped inside Maslow and not
published as source, so this repository does not go public with them in
it.

The wallpapers under apps/web/public/wallpapers are photographs, each
cut to 2560 by 1600 from an original found on Wikimedia Commons or in
the image library of the National Aeronautics and Space Administration
(NASA), and credited on its tile in Settings and here:
