  aurora.jpg    Aneta P. — "Zorza polarna i perseid" — CC BY 4.0
  milkyway.jpg  ESO / H. H. Heyer — "360-degree Panorama of the Southern Sky" — CC BY 4.0
  peak.jpg      Willi Winzig — "Matterhorn by Moonlight" — CC BY 2.0
  falls.jpg     Matthew Roth — "Skogafoss in Iceland" — CC BY 2.0
  fog.jpg       Annie Spratt — "Foggy Winter morning" — CC0
